Subject: [PATCH] [SW-188535] g3: security: ported function from preboot rtos

Ported security function required to validate svn and validate
public key & index from preboot rtos.

Moved security code common between Gaudi2 and Gaudi3 into
lib/common/security.c to reuse in both places

Change-Id: I7d4478ad4444d730f09f681ae0a87a93eb5071c8
Signed-off-by: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
